}])
},
&"condition_as_text": "not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Dolly\")",
&"id": "98",
&"next_id": "99",
&"responses": PackedStringArray("98", "102", "106"),
&"text": "Pick Dolly",
&"type": "response"
},
"99": {
&"character": "Chief",
&"id": "99",
&"next_id": "100",
&"text": "We'll add Dolly to the team.",
&"type": "dialogue"
}
}
raw_text = "~ start
Chief: Hi. Welcome to Sparta, New Jersey. I'm the police chief. We can use your help. Are you interested?
- Yes, what can I do?
- Quit
	Chief: [[I knew you weren't up to it.|Fine, stop wasting my time, then.|Okay, maybe next time.]]
	do GlobalVars.quit.emit()
	=> END

~ SuspectList
Chief: Okay. Here is a list of suspects that we need to catch. Let me know which of these you can help with.
- Keith (easy)
	Keith: Keith should be easy to catch. He's not too bright and doesn't have any particular skills.
	- Pick Keith
		Chief: He shouldn't give you much of a problem. Good luck bringing Keith in.
		# Set the suspect threat level
		set GlobalVars.sus_name = \"Keith\"
		set GlobalVars.sus_threat_profile = GlobalVars.threat_profile_a
	- Pick someone else
		=> SuspectList
- Patti (medium)
	Patti: Patti is a bit tricky. She is good at avoiding capture but she does take risks. She has a few tricks up her sleave.
	- Pick Patti
		Chief: Patti will give you a challenge. Good luck bringing in Patti.
		# Set the suspect threat level
		set GlobalVars.sus_name = \"Patti\"
		set GlobalVars.sus_threat_profile = GlobalVars.threat_profile_b
	- Pick someone else
		=> SuspectList
- Mo (hard)
	Mo: Capturing Mo won't be easy. He is very cautious and has a few skills that will make him hard to capture.
	- Pick Mo
		Chief: He will be tough. Good luck bringing in Mo.
		# Set the suspect threat level
		set GlobalVars.sus_name = \"Mo\"
		set GlobalVars.sus_threat_profile = GlobalVars.threat_profile_c
	- Pick someone else
		=> SuspectList
- I changed my mind. I have better things to do.
	Chief: [[I understand. See ya around.|Cupcake|Fine, we didn't need your help anyway.]]
	do GlobalVars.quit.emit()
	=> END

~ AgentListIntro
Chief: Now you need to assemble your team. We work in teams of five. Select five agents from this list. Each agent has a unique skill that will be useful for you in your mission.
~ AgentList
# List the names of those already selected if any are selected
match GlobalVars.agent_name.size()
	when 0
		Chief: Here is the list:
	when 1
		Chief: So far, only {{GlobalVars.agent_name[0]}} is on the team. Pick four more.
	when 2
		Chief: So far we have {{GlobalVars.agent_name[0]}} and {{GlobalVars.agent_name[1]}}. Pick three more.
	when 3
		Chief: So far we have {{GlobalVars.agent_name[0]}}, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[1]}}, and {{GlobalVars.agent_name[2]}}. Pick two more.
	when 4
		Chief: So far we have {{GlobalVars.agent_name[0]}}, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[1]}}, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[2]}}, and {{GlobalVars.agent_name[3]}}. Almost there. Pick one more.
	when 5
		Chief: We have our team: {{GlobalVars.agent_name[0]}}, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[1]}}, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[2]}}, {{GlobalVars.agent_name[3]}}, and {{GlobalVars.agent_name[4]}}. If you're satisfied we can start deploying them, or you can go back and keep editing the list.
# List the selected names
- Arthur
	Arthur: Arthur is able to use the water pathways. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Arthur\")]Would you like to add Arthur to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Arthur\")]Arthur is already selected. Would you like remove Arthur?[/if]
	- Pick Arthur [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Arthur\")]
		Chief: We'll add Arthur to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Arthur\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Arthur [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Arthur\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Arthur from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Arthur\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Bertha
	Bertha: Bertha has some psychic abilities and is able to sense the suspect's tension. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Bertha\")]Would you like to add Bertha to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Bertha\")]Bertha is already selected. Would you like remove Bertha?[/if]
	- Pick Bertha [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Bertha\")]
		Chief: We'll add Bertha to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Bertha\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Bertha [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Bertha\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Bertha from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Bertha\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Cristobal
	Cristobal: Cristobal is able to plant a listening device at an intersection. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Cristobal\")]Would you like to add Cristobal to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Cristobal\")]Cristobal is already selected. Would you like remove Cristobal?[/if]
	- Pick Cristobal [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Cristobal\")]
		Chief: We'll add Cristobal to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Cristobal\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Cristobal [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Cristobal\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Cristobal from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Cristobal\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Dolly
	Dolly: Dolly is able to place a blockade on an intersection. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Dolly\")]Would you like to add Dolly to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Dolly\")]Dolly is already selected. Would you like remove Dolly?[/if]
	- Pick Dolly [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Dolly\")]
		Chief: We'll add Dolly to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Dolly\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Dolly [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Dolly\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Dolly from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Dolly\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Edouard
	Edouard: Edouard's special ability is unknown. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\")]Would you like to add Edouard to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\")]Edouard is already selected. Would you like remove Edouard?[/if]
	- Pick Edouard [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\")]
		Chief: We'll add Edouard to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Edouard\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Edouard [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Edouard\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Edouard from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Edouard\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Fay
	Fay: Fay's special ability is unknown. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Fay\")]Would you like to add Fay to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Fay\")]Fay is already selected. Would you like remove Fay?[/if]
	- Pick Fay [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Fay\")]
		Chief: We'll add Fay to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Fay\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Fay [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Fay\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Fay from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Fay\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Gonzalo
	Gonzalo: Gonzalo's special ability is unknown. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Gonzalo\")]Would you like to add Gonzalo to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Gonzalo\")]Gonzalo is already selected. Would you like remove Gonzalo?[/if]
	- Pick Gonzalo [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Gonzalo\")]
		Chief: We'll add Gonzalo to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Gonzalo\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Gonzalo [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Gonzalo\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Gonzalo from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Gonzalo\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again
		=> AgentList
- Hanna
	Hanna: Hanna is able to summon a sixth agent to help. [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Hanna\")]Would you like to add Hanna to the team?[/if] [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Hanna\")]Hanna is already selected. Would you like remove Hanna?[/if]
	- Pick Hanna [if not GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Hanna\")]
		Chief: We'll add Hanna to the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.append(\"Hanna\")
		=> AgentList
	- Remove Hanna [if GlobalVars.agent_name.has(\"Hanna\")]
		Chief: We'll remove Hanna from the team.
		set GlobalVars.agent_name.erase(\"Hanna\")
		=> AgentList
	- Let me see the list again.
		=> AgentList
- My team is complete. Let's get started!  [if GlobalVars.agent_name.size() == 5]
- I changed my mind. I have better things to do.
	Chief: [[I understand. See ya around.|Cupcake|Fine, we didn't need your help anyway.]]
	do GlobalVars.quit.emit()
	=> END

~ StartGame
Chief: Now that the team is in place, you must deploy them around Sparta. You can place them on a few key intersections around town. After all five agents are in place we can start our pursuit.
do GlobalVars.agent_name.insert(0,\"IGNORE\")
do GlobalVars.team_selected_from_dialogue.emit()
=> END
"
